BUG-38: lcl_NotifyContent looks for flys in content only in a frame that has one.

Every time an anchored object moves, Notify_Background notifies each content frame of the
page, and lcl_NotifyContent then walked all of that frame's anchored objects to pass the
notification on to the content of flys anchored as character. A paragraph that anchors n
objects (our PDF -> DOCX output anchors thousands in one paragraph) paid n per notification,
and each of its objects' moves sends one: 1.9 billion objects looked at, and 0 flys in content
found, in the first 180 s of a 7,716-anchor document; 22 s of its 200 s layout.

SwSortedObjs now counts its flys in content (in Insert and Remove, the only places the list
changes; a fly is in content from construction, SwFlyInContentFrame), and lcl_NotifyContent
skips the walk when the count is 0. The walk did nothing for such a frame.

Not WASM-specific. Documents module only for now.

diff --git a/sw/source/core/inc/sortedobjs.hxx b/sw/source/core/inc/sortedobjs.hxx
--- a/sw/source/core/inc/sortedobjs.hxx
+++ b/sw/source/core/inc/sortedobjs.hxx
@@ -51,6 +51,8 @@
         std::vector< SwAnchoredObject* > maSortedObjLst;
         /// Verified sorted in the current BulkInsertScope (see there).
         bool mbVerifiedInBulk = false;
+        /// How many of the listed objects are flys in content (anchored as character).
+        size_t mnFlysInContent = 0;
     public:
         /** Frame creation appends the anchored objects of a range of nodes one after another,
             and nothing changes a sort criterion of a listed object in between: a list that is
@@ -111,6 +113,10 @@
         size_t ListPosOf( const SwAnchoredObject& _rAnchoredObj ) const;
 
         bool is_sorted() const;
+        /// Whether the list holds a fly in content (SwFlyFrame::IsFlyInContentFrame): a fly is
+        /// one from construction (SwFlyInContentFrame), and the list changes only in Insert and
+        /// Remove, which keep the count.
+        bool HasFlyInContent() const { return mnFlysInContent != 0; }
 };
 
 #endif
diff --git a/sw/source/core/layout/sortedobjs.cxx b/sw/source/core/layout/sortedobjs.cxx
--- a/sw/source/core/layout/sortedobjs.cxx
+++ b/sw/source/core/layout/sortedobjs.cxx
@@ -29,6 +29,16 @@
 #include <svx/svdobj.hxx>
 #include <IDocumentDrawModelAccess.hxx>
 #include <osl/diagnose.h>
+#include <flyfrm.hxx>
+
+namespace
+{
+bool lcl_IsFlyInContent(const SwAnchoredObject& rObj)
+{
+    const SwFlyFrame* pFly = rObj.DynCastFlyFrame();
+    return pFly && pFly->IsFlyInContentFrame();
+}
+}
 
 using namespace ::com::sun::star;
 
@@ -281,6 +291,8 @@
 
     // insert object into list
     maSortedObjLst.insert( aInsPosIter, &_rAnchoredObj );
+    if (lcl_IsFlyInContent(_rAnchoredObj))
